                rdfs:label "Forest fire risk"@en ;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Wildfire risk"@en ;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A risk assessment concept representing the potential for wildfire ignition and propagation in forest ecosystems."@en .


###  http://purl.org/ffonto#ForestFireRiskFactor
:ForestFireRiskFactor rdf:type owl:Class ;
