             rdfs:subClassOf :LandCoverChange ;
             rdfs:comment "Expansion of urban areas into natural landscapes increasing ignition sources." ;
             rdfs:label "Urban Growth" .


###  http://purl.org/ffonto#UrbanWildlandInterface
:UrbanWildlandInterface rdf:type owl:Class ;
