                     rdfs:label "Planned Utility Power Shutoff (PSPS)" .


###  http://purl.org/ffonto#UtilitySystem
:UtilitySystem rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:comment "Infrastructure systems such as water or gas supply." ;
               rdfs:label "Utility System" .


