:reducesSpreadOfOf rdfs:comment "Inverse relation linking spread-reduction measures back to the targets or areas they protect."@en .


:regrowthOfSpeciesOf rdfs:comment "Inverse relation linking species regrowth records back to the areas or treatments where they occurred."@en .


